# QR Menu — Smart Restaurant Ordering System (v2 — Updated)

## Problem Statement

Build a QR-code based contactless ordering system where:
- Restaurant owners register, configure a single customizable menu, generate table-specific QR codes
- Customers scan a QR code at their table, browse an interactive menu, and place orders
- Kitchen view shows incoming orders in real-time (read-only, scroll-only for kitchen staff)
- Admin dashboard shows ALL orders + invoice generation
- GPS proximity validation prevents spam orders from outside the restaurant
- No payment gateway; invoice generation on admin dashboard

